{"id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-block-sensitivity.md","title":"Block Sensitivity","display":"df-block-sensitivity — Block Sensitivity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-block-sensitivity","aliases":["28-df-block-sensitivity"],"display":"df-block-sensitivity — Block Sensitivity","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.10","source_printed_pages":"266","source_pdf_pages":"292","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-block-sensitivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-block-sensitivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-block-sensitivity — Block Sensitivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"266"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"292"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^{\\oplus S}\">\\(x^{\\oplus S}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a>。</li>\n<li>候选块为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 的非空子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=0\">\\(b=0\\)</span> 时块族为空并满足全部逐块条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge_{i=1}^b[\\varnothing\\ne B_i\\subseteq[n]\\land f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus B_i})]\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le b}(B_i\\cap B_j=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge_{i=1}^b[\\varnothing\\ne B_i\\subseteq[n]\\land f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus B_i})]\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le b}(B_i\\cap B_j=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"bs_x(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}:\\exists B_1,\\ldots,B_b\\ \\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\},\\qquad bs(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}bs_x(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[bs_x(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}:\\exists B_1,\\ldots,B_b\\ \\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\},\\qquad bs(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}bs_x(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空块族保证候选非空；不相交非空块数至多n，故最大值达到。本条定义仅涉及函数值的改变，不将块大小或是否极小暗加为条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.10；印刷页 266；PDF 页 292。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Block Sensitivity，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R7复核：按 Definition 12.10（PDF292）保留固定输入/全局两个层次；全局最大值明确在有限非空输入集上取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"cff47baaf3aae6af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"cff47baaf3aae6af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$，$b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$x^{\\oplus S}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x^{\\oplus S}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"b=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\leftrightarrow\\bigwedge_{i=1}^b[\\varnothing\\ne B_i\\subseteq[n]\\land f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus B_i})]\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\le i<j\\le b}(B_i\\cap B_j=\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"bs_x(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}:\\exists B_1,\\ldots,B_b\\ \\operatorname{SB}_f(x;B_1,\\ldots,B_b)\\},\\qquad bs(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}bs_x(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1864,"backlinks":[{"id":"bbc032dc63b4bea2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"},{"id":"838a6fb712f8a04f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"12ca2ea9396c7639","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。"}],"outgoing":["cff47baaf3aae6af"]}